## 3. SQLModel Standard (MANDATORY)

- **No Raw SQL**: Use `session.exec(select(Model))` — NEVER `session.execute(text(...))` or `session.query()`.
- **Session-First**: CRUD functions MUST have `session: Session` as FIRST parameter.
- **CRUD Isolation**: All DB logic in `engine/db/utils/db_core_crud.py`.
- **Model Validation**: Use `Model.model_validate(payload)` to convert schemas.

**Quick Reference:**

| Pattern | Code |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Session DI** | `session: Session = Depends(get_session)` |
| **List All** | `session.exec(select(Model)).all()` |
| **Filter** | `session.exec(select(Model).where(Model.field == value)).first()` |

**Reference:** [`agentic/AGENT.md:1345-1578`](agentic/AGENT.md:1345)

