## Pre-Commit Checklist

- [ ] All files under 200 lines (or refactored to `tasks/`)
- [ ] All functions have `FN:` docstring prefix
- [ ] No raw SQL (use SQLModel `select()`)
- [ ] No print statements (use logger)
- [ ] Type hints on all functions
- [ ] Docker build passes: `bash scripts/docker-build-verify.sh --all`
- [ ] Tests pass: `python3 tests/main.py`
- [ ] No secrets in code (check `config.ini`)
- [ ] Dependencies pinned with CVE comments

